silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_07_tier1prime_extensions_concrete_anchor#traversalgovernance silm:hasLongDescription "The TraversalGovernance is the Mittens microchip-id witness 985112000123456 entering as a typed identifier source leg into the Music engine cocone. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{TraversalGovernance} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
