silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_07_tier1prime_extensions_concrete_anchor#forbiddenpathrules silm:hasLongDescription "The ForbiddenPathRules is the Mittens coat-pattern observation (torbie, three-color) entering as a typed quality-claim into the manifest profile reader. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ForbiddenPathRules}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
