silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_07_tier1prime_extensions_concrete_anchor#_ silm:hasLongDescription "The \\ is the Mittens domestic-cat classification leg (DomesticCat) as a typed source-leg arrow that anchors BY Mittens, not as an identity. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_07_tier1prime_extensions_concrete_anchor#manifestcache a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.07_tier1prime_extensions.concrete_anchor#manifestcache" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_07_tier1prime_extensions_concrete_anchor#manifestcache silm:hasLongDescription "The ManifestCache is the Felis catus / TSN 183798 taxonomy source leg, recoverable as a typed leg into D_Mittens but not interchangeable with the colimit apex Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ManifestCache}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
