silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_07_tier1prime_extensions_concrete_anchor#traversal silm:hasLongDescription "The Traversal is the ShapeGate that validates the body-mass measurement schema (kg, range 2-12) before admission to the task node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{Traversal}  \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
