silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_07_tier1prime_extensions_concrete_anchor#ologclaim silm:hasLongDescription "The OlogClaim is the TraceWitness emitted from the body-mass measurement task, the outgoing-profile representative of the typed work. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{OlogClaim}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
